Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ipmi-fan-control
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11~), ipmitool, smartmontools, util-linux, systemd
Description: Local IPMI fan control for a Dell PowerEdge R730xd
 Temperature-aware fan controller for a specific dual-CPU R730xd running
 Proxmox VE. Reads local IPMI and SMART sensors before switching to manual
 fan control and restores automatic control when the controller exits.
 .
 The service is not enabled or started during package installation.
